<title>INDIA: TISCO Q1 97/98 sales up yr-on-yr 10 pct.</title>
<headline>TISCO Q1 97/98 sales up yr-on-yr 10 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tata Iron and Steel Company Ltd's (TISCO) sales rose by 10 percent in the first quarter of 1997/98 (April-March) from the same period a year earlier, Chairman Ratan Tata told a shareholders' meeting on Thursday.  </p>
<p>Tata said that the company's total income for the first quarter was up 11 percent from the same quarter of the 1996/97 financial year.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
